SUMMARY:Cactus Kate and the Pricks | Fridays In The RAD Music Series
DESCRIPTION:Excited to return this Friday. We’ll be playing our original songs alongside some well loved classics and country deep cuts. This is a free show and all ages are welcome! \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nRecords in the RAD in the River Arts District is a thoughtfully curated record store with an eclectic selection of vinyl\, both new and used. In addition to records\, we also have a music inspired art gallery\, which features artwork from Brian\, Dylan and Susan Haynes. recordsintherad.com \nAt Wedge Brewing\, we got our start in the River Arts District\, and therefore hold art and community very close to us. We create beer for the creatives and give them a place to commune. wedgebrewing.com \n \n  \n  \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/jamie-hendrickson-trio-fridays-in-the-rad-music-series-2/
LOCATION:Records in the RAD/The Wedge
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/746791606_17958679074154427_8680748981608420174_n-e1783955963189.jpg
END:VEVENT
